{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39547","headline":"送南海僧游蜀 · 张蠙","name":"送南海僧游蜀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"真修绝故乡，一衲度暄凉。\n此世能先觉，他生岂再忘。\n定中船过海，腊後路沿湘。\n野迥鸦随笠，山深虎背囊。\n瀑流垂石室，萝蔓盖铜梁。\n却後何年会，西方有上房。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张蠙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39547.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39547","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}